# Swamp Thing — a "Play Deck" folder deck installed by Duels of the Planeswalkers (1998): a ready-made
# player deck that shipped in the expansion's files but was not offered in-game (the precon
# page: "users would need to open the game's files and move them into a different directory").
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer (precon page, ref. 3); the .dck files are dated 19 September 1996
# colours: B
# source: ../mage-go/data/preconstructed_decks.yaml shandalar.player_decks.coyote_tex ["Swamp
#   Thing"] [Tier 3 — mage-go's transcription of the expansion's Play Deck files]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Player_Decks_(Coyote_Tex) — "Swamp Thing"
#   [Tier-web — agrees card for card]
# group: Coyote Tex's decks
name: Swamp Thing
4 Bog Wraith
4 Lost Soul
4 Scathe Zombies
2 Will-o'-the-Wisp
4 Zombie Master
2 Raise Dead
2 Ashes to Ashes
2 Drain Life
4 Black Vise
4 Bad Moon
4 Blight
4 Evil Presence
22 Swamp
